<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys back off market at NZ$7.21.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys back off market at NZ$7.21.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of NZ said on Monday it had bought back 711,150 shares on-market at NZ$7.21 each, bringing the total number of issued shares to 1,802,633,214.</p>
<p>The total excludes 38,606,026 held as treasury stock.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
</text>
